  "about": "Hi, I’m Aric, a photographer based in California with a passion for wildlife, nature, and travel photography.\n\nThrough this site, I share snippets from local wildlife, natural landscapes, and my adventures. My goal is to create photographs that people can enjoy, share, and proudly display in their homes.\n\nWhen I’m not behind the camera, I’m attending California State University, San Bernardino. Where my interests in marine biology, ecology, and conservation influence the way I see and photograph the world. \n\nThank you for visiting my website. I hope these images inspire you to explore, appreciate, and protect the natural world around us. Feel free to browse the site and learn more about the research I’m involved in with my mentor, Dr. Joseph Heras. josephheras.weebly.com",
